{"seq": 14, "tick": 24, "wall": "2026-08-21T06:07:36+00:00", "type": "llm_call", "data": {"key": "24:a_wang:act", "tier": "routine", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "temperature": null, "usage": {"inp": 4757, "out": 199, "c_write": 0, "c_read": 0}, "output": {"thought": "這傻小子總算開竅了，趁現在風向沒變，趕緊把他帶上高地，離海堤越遠越好。", "action": {"kind": "move_to", "target_area": "高地", "target_agent": "", "utterance": "", "object": "", "art": ""}, "plan": "跟阿海一起快步前往高地，到達安全位置後就待著不動，直到暴潮過去。"}, "error": null}}
